---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../../consts';
---
<Base lang="en" alternates={[{ lang: 'ko', href: '/about/' }, { lang: 'en', href: '/en/about/' }]} title="About" description={`About ${SITE_TITLE} and how we write.`}>
  <div class="prose">
    <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
    <p>
      {SITE_TITLE} explains the stories people are searching for right now. We cover any topic, from news and
      the economy to everyday life, entertainment, sports and tech, and pick the keywords trending that day so you can
      quickly understand what happened, what is actually true, and why it matters.
    </p>

    <h2>How we write</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>We compare sources.</strong> Every post draws on several reports and official documents, not a single article.</li>
      <li><strong>We separate facts from claims.</strong> Confirmed information and unverified claims are labeled as such.</li>
      <li><strong>We add context.</strong> Background and what happens next, the parts news coverage often leaves out.</li>
      <li><strong>We cite our sources.</strong> Links to what we used appear at the end of each post.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      AI tools may help with early drafts, but every post is reviewed by the editor for accuracy and sourcing before
      it is published. If you spot a mistake, let us know and we will correct it and note the change.
    </p>

    <h2>Who runs this site</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE_TITLE} is run by an independent developer who builds iPhone apps and games.
      You can see them on the <a href="/apps/">Apps</a> page (in Korean).
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Tips, corrections and questions: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
